#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-audit-overview.md:1
#: 07412d1271f34d6f87316950c38602a0
msgid "概览与快速体检"
msgstr "Overview and quick health check"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-audit-overview.md:3
#: c592612505e543349382610a389c8b18
msgid "先看当前结论和数据概况，再处理训练阻塞项与建议复核项。"
msgstr "Read the current conclusion and data summary first, then handle training blockers and recommended review items."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:714
#: 1e4564655f784e898194a04063997fe7
msgid "「概览」先回答 3 个问题："
msgstr "The Overview answers three questions first:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:716
#: d9315761f9884fa98a5f317bd7d0630b
msgid "有没有空结构、非法数值、标签形状错误等训练阻塞项；"
msgstr "Are there blockers such as empty structures, invalid values, or malformed labels?"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:717
#: 48eee15d65f24cb29a3ed00a8e686f4e
msgid "当前数据包含哪些精确组分、元素和标签；"
msgstr "Which exact compositions, elements, and labels are present?"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:718
#: 26028860b184404c88fb626d13296db2
msgid "哪些高力、高能量、重复或低频集合值得先复核。"
msgstr "Which high-force, high-energy, duplicate, or low-frequency groups should be reviewed first?"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:720
#: 6e4683fe5a2947238f1d94c9084b30a9
msgid ""
"点击复核项后，下方会显示观察事实、解释和能力边界。再点击显示结构按钮，即可返"
"回原页面，并选中该项对应的真实结构。"
msgstr "After selecting a review item, the panel below shows observations, explanations, and capability limits. Click Show structures to return to the original page with the corresponding structures selected."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:722
#: aa482c9e0dd746fa9fb24340d915d69a
msgid ""
"训练集评估概览页，标出当前结论、数据概况、建议复核顺序和 HTML 报告导出入口"
msgstr "Training Set Audit overview showing the current conclusion, data summary, recommended review order, and HTML report export"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:722
#: aa482c9e0dd746fa9fb24340d915d69a
msgid ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/training_set_audit_overview.png"
msgstr ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/training_set_audit_overview.png"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:727
#: f8ca590065a443ffa401438e8b805fcb
msgid ""
"图中的编号就是推荐阅读顺序：先读当前结论，再确认本次检查了多少结构和标签，随"
"后按「建议下一步」进入复核队列。只有需要留档或发给合作者时，才使用右上角的 "
"HTML 导出。"
msgstr "The numbers in the figure show the recommended reading order: read the current conclusion first, confirm how many structures and labels were checked, and then use “Suggested next step” to open the review queue. Use the HTML export in the upper-right only when you need an archive or a report for collaborators."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:3330
#: da17472ec94c47508c1c80b0e7f38b09
msgid "快速体检检查什么"
msgstr "What the quick health check covers"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:3332
#: d60d89c2b46d470ea9846115a7cc424c
msgid "训练阻塞项"
msgstr "Training blockers"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:3334
#: 413e4ec353e4403a9b5cf2f5e8d8ce2a
msgid "以下结果违反明确的数据契约，应在训练前处理："
msgstr "The following results violate explicit data contracts and should be handled before training:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:3336
#: bb85a40f9c6b4aebbf8c3520d386a516
msgid "空结构；"
msgstr "empty structures;"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:3337
#: 20570de65fcc4aa2b0784fe4cb37fa12
msgid "位置、晶胞或标签中的 `NaN / Inf`；"
msgstr "`NaN / Inf` in positions, cells, or labels;"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:3338
#: 1a32334be50d4618b53ed8ea59afd412
msgid "位置、力、virial 等数组形状错误；"
msgstr "incorrect array shapes for positions, forces, virials, and similar fields;"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:3339
#: ae42914657a24a17aa777a528b588a3f
msgid "周期方向与晶胞不一致；"
msgstr "periodic directions inconsistent with the cell;"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:3340
#: 140a75684a3b4b608591bcf0855d4462
msgid "未知元素，或元素数量与原子数不一致；"
msgstr "unknown elements, or an element count inconsistent with the atom count;"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:3341
#: 7d07859b025148649d466cc8eb885801
msgid "最短原子距离小于 `0.5 Å` 的保守重叠信号；"
msgstr "a conservative overlap signal with a shortest atomic distance below `0.5 Å`;"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:3342
#: 4d8e6ad99fa34c6c88668ce2f6bb13c7
msgid "相同几何对应互相冲突的能量、力或 virial 标签。"
msgstr "conflicting energy, force, or virial labels for the same geometry."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:3344
#: e697b8ff6104439ea0e7b552c2648d9f
msgid ""
"相同几何按元素、周期边界、晶胞和坐标共同判断；晶胞与坐标比较到小数点后 8 位。"
"冲突标签的当前绝对容差为：能量 `1 × 10⁻⁵`、力 `1 × 10⁻⁵`、virial `1 × 10⁻⁴`，"
"相对容差为 `0`。"
msgstr "The same geometry is identified from its elements, periodic boundaries, cell, and coordinates; cells and coordinates are compared to 8 decimal places. The current absolute tolerances for conflicting labels are `1 × 10⁻⁵` for energy and force and `1 × 10⁻⁴` for virial, with a relative tolerance of `0`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:3346
#: cfa79779f40f4f6c9f6904e6c099d1c8
msgid ""
"软件不会自动删除阻塞结构，也不会替用户决定哪一次重复计算才正确。应先回到结构"
"来源和 DFT 输出核对。"
msgstr "The application does not delete blockers automatically or decide which duplicate calculation is correct. Check the structure source and DFT output first."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:3348
#: 3a17785042d04b7daa998bb7ad91eaec
msgid "建议复核项"
msgstr "Recommended review items"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:3350
#: 9df8990fd0714dd7a91159a4787e6923
msgid "最大力最高的 10%；"
msgstr "the top 10% by maximum force;"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:3351
#: 2470b1402f084f649a091cace4b2fdd9
msgid "单原子能量最高的 5%；"
msgstr "the top 5% by per-atom energy;"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:3352
#: 952a04b59ac24a579895d61e31aaafb7
msgid "重复几何；"
msgstr "duplicate geometries;"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:3353
#: baafc9fd301b4d80ab0885f8c91d65b9
msgid "当前数据内部的低频组分、低频局域环境或不平衡集合。"
msgstr "low-frequency compositions, local environments, or imbalanced groups in the current data."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:3355
#: 2e6822b0306a45f5b83cffc7843f465d
msgid ""
"固定分位集合按排名必然产生。高力、高能量或重复结构可能来自真实目标物理、显式"
"加权或独立计算，因此这些结果是复核入口，不是删除建议。"
msgstr "Fixed-quantile groups are produced directly from ranking. High-force, high-energy, or duplicate structures may reflect the intended physics, explicit weighting, or independent calculations, so these results are review entry points rather than deletion recommendations."
